#: apps/calculator/data/org.helixdesktop.Calculator.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"Calculator solves everything from simple sums to scientific, financial and "
"programming problems. Type an expression the way you would write it, or use "
"the keypad. Earlier results stay in the history so you can reuse them."
